39. REAL MERGE CONFLICT SCENARIO
============================================================

Suppose:

main:
A --- B --- C

feature:
A --- B --- D

Now merge:

git switch main
git merge feature

Conflict may occur.

Check:

git status

Open conflicted file.

Resolve:

<<<<<<< HEAD
main code
=======
feature code
>>>>>>> feature

Remove conflict markers and keep the required code.

Then:

git add .

git commit -m "Resolve merge conflict"


